{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_title", "source_sha256": "6a0080925a5f119e88771d989ad166deddaeded5cacf4e5cb34ed968e12596f9", "ja": "恋するキモチ", "zh": "恋慕的心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_synopsis", "source_sha256": "430c193a36819e0a21dcd0dcea074a3332430bf113388dc6a85b1fa273456f22", "ja": "新曲公演で瑞希が披露する事になったのは、\n恋の歌。表現に悩む瑞希を励ますプロデュー\nサーに、公演の後に話したい事があると言う\n瑞希。大盛況のライブ後、瑞希は、今はやめ\nておきます、と言って微笑むのだった。", "zh": "瑞希在新曲公演中要表演的，是一首\n情歌。面对因表现手法而烦恼的瑞希，制作人\n给予了鼓励，而瑞希则表示在公演后有话想对\n他说。在反响热烈的演出结束后，瑞希却微笑着\n说，现在还是先不说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae3bd1429e03ed4b7447aa3c92085af7739a23301159e1249040da4a7fe636b0", "ja": "（次の公演のレッスンが始まった。海美と美希、\nそれに今日から美奈子とエレナも合流だ）", "zh": "（下场公演的练习开始了。海美和美希，还有美奈子和艾蕾娜也从今天起加入了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "79261fe429ad3ba57813b390d7af52e3859c5042389640dd49996ea96ae03f36", "ja": "ミズキの新しい曲、聴いたヨ！\nクールなナンバーで、カッコよかったネ♪", "zh": "我听了瑞希的新歌哦！是首很酷的曲子，太帅气了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "0c6d3a35f7d01e44062e7d0d582ede62f9e54909e0c6d3806c8d97ed78db59b2", "ja": "うん、素敵な曲だった！　瑞希ちゃん、\n私も精いっぱいお手伝いするから、何でも言ってね♪", "zh": "嗯，是一首很棒的歌呢！瑞希，\n我也一定会全力帮忙的，有什么事尽管说哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "b07206d257129deb95e93b8b91372094ddb040210ce4126c04c2b79b7e6adcfc", "ja": "おふたりとも、ありがとうございます。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "两位都非常感谢。\n我才要请你们多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "7078210c6b6dd9f7bcc67c688043b9215d4e9964cffe360efd555fad9c3bd61c", "ja": "ダンスは、ワタシたちが盛り上げるからネ♪\nミズキは安心して、えっと……ドロブネ？", "zh": "舞蹈就交给我们来炒热气氛吧♪  \n瑞希放心，呃……泥船？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "0ed780bb6360506654130c7881a5b0ed2ee44f9ae03d7608c0a07f8553c01a77", "ja": "泥舟じゃ沈んじゃうよ、エレナちゃん！　安心して、\n大船に乗ったつもりでいてね、ってことだよね？", "zh": "泥船会沉下去的，艾丽娜！你是想说“放心，就把自己当作坐上大船”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "14120dcb1ab950cb00f3f1eb9976bbfda041e2ab5f01db3c58c9608a2ca6e259", "ja": "あっ、それだヨー。エヘヘ、間違えちゃった！\nとにかく、ワタシたちにまかせてネ、ミズキ♪", "zh": "啊，就是那个啦——。嘿嘿，弄错了！\n总之，交给我们吧，瑞希♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "04f246c1f80287b7ae0b53974e76938f734128a1ee69c2a29efadcb180b17c42", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\n……みなさん、頼もしい。", "zh": "好的，谢谢大家。\n……大家真可靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "bdbc7dd9f90d749e060e470e6098bd4f5cb8357dcff5c9ea1003d3c26c729766", "ja": "それじゃ、早速ダンスレッスン始めるよーっ！\nみんな、準備はいい？", "zh": "那就马上开始舞蹈训练——！\n大家，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "97bb18c9ee6664e600d49ac23202a01795b71111f7ce57d41fdf09410eb5bc5b", "ja": "はいなの♪", "zh": "好～的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "56e67a8b089d0a34f8228a23d452aa74c84b89a8c790845bba9ebd0f4d166a2f", "ja": "みずきん、それじゃまだまだ足りないよ！\nもっと大きく動いて！", "zh": "瑞希，这样还远远不够哦！\n动作再大一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "9e8634c0a72cde5268a013c7520ccaa2027e8c8d705575ea1e50d411b9f47df0", "ja": "そうだヨ！　ミズキの曲なんだから、\n誰よりも目立つくらいじゃないとネ！", "zh": "对呀！这是瑞希的歌，\n不做到比任何人都显眼可不行哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "18f2973727aedc19038a4f9910bdffa188b2d689be1a6f74a19f51a3c6c36113", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。もっと大きく、ですか……。\nですが、どうしたら……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……还要更大声吗……。\n可是，该怎么做呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "37067049688726c4cef8865c9f6af761e8b6a1ce454c1adb0679dde4167c6225", "ja": "それじゃ、ミキがお手本見せてあげるね。\nワン、ツー、スリー、フォー。はいなの！", "zh": "那就由美希来给你示范一下吧。\n一、二、三、四。好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "0edfe6568596c74f71bfe32e42821ec92b86bfef086f30b2478f67b702612d6d", "ja": "おーっ。\nさすが美希ちゃん、バッチリ決まってるね！", "zh": "哦——！\n不愧是美希，动作做得太漂亮了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "5840924c960ccb846656ea60d535c399524445c3bfbafad58b9440e3a5f46fcf", "ja": "さすが。すごいな、星井さん。\n……。", "zh": "不愧是你。真厉害啊，星井同学。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "8c2d6088c2e656bcadc468af9c5e698b872390dbe7ff62b7a09e876bb6921f7f", "ja": "ミズキ？", "zh": "瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "b456ee39faa21b8042cfa75d124f9de4a2bc9516d6e110f0104e00313dc38946", "ja": "あ……いえ、なんでもありません。わかりました、\nやってみます。ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……！", "zh": "啊……不，没什么。我明白了，\n我会试试的。一、二、三、四……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6618a58ac35dc6e82263830dfd9edca0b36dc2e5d9a5719b9bfbb80d5be322d7", "ja": "（海美、エレナ、美希のダンスに、瑞希が\n食らいついていってる。これは期待できそうだな！）", "zh": "（海美、艾蕾娜和美希的舞蹈，瑞希也拼命跟上了。看来很有希望啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "07213182e618b643bd4fbab04bfa90d3ef101c9b894350f319ed803ec945220d", "ja": "うひゃー、初日のレッスンから飛ばしたねー。\nみずきん、大丈夫？　筋肉痛になってない？", "zh": "呜哇——第一天的课程就这么拼啊。\n瑞希，你没事吧？没有肌肉酸痛吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba6abcc9a9d0588e26e24ca9b09d4a72e5ff84580af26d08f31072d52c70e95a", "ja": "大丈夫……では、なさそうです。\n先ほどから、足がプルプルしています。", "zh": "看起来……并不太好。\n刚才开始，腿就在一直打颤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "6bded49e9fdd6d3dc535b75c6a3e1f960153b0e0a7d418cbcdf5ee80a88e4467", "ja": "わわ！？　瑞希ちゃん、生まれたての\n小鹿みたいになっちゃってるよ！　少し冷やそうね！", "zh": "哇哇！？瑞希，你都变得像刚出生的\n小鹿一样了！得稍微冰敷一下呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "4d72593c0e4aa2f542c9245bfc37a405028d380b6b07fb3bd576e9e7e7a05904", "ja": "……お気遣いありがとうございます、佐竹さん。\n……優しい。", "zh": "……谢谢您的关心，佐竹同学。\n……真温柔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "dc6307e01caa0d3a300de5c0782aad9b7e1d8f82da388b0c6cd937e082eac61c", "ja": "えへへ、そんなことないよ！\nはい、アイシング。これで冷やしてね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，没那回事啦！\n来，冰敷袋。用这个冷敷一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "c71961ee77d254d2645e3d563708f36fb4d80896c1c66d418abdb7fe9ce7c833", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\n……新曲、難しいですね。もっと練習しないと。", "zh": "好的，谢谢你。\n……新歌真难啊。还得多练习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "86bf120d7c0341b610c3f76f38d27376a8222f537d3c148c70d873db5556217a", "ja": "えっ、そうかな？　ダンスレッスンは、\n今日一日で、けっこう進んだと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？我觉得舞蹈课今天一天已经进展得挺顺利了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "f32b078353d054f430992f90c75cc66141ff04fb892ba27024ef312f088fecc4", "ja": "ワタシもそう思うヨ。あとはみんなでたくさん\nレッスンすれば、公演には余裕で間に合うと思うナ。", "zh": "我也这么觉得哦。接下来只要大家多多练习，应该能轻轻松松赶上公演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "44a80b1743a2199835afde5209c0f4ae73a7fb81abfe915c3116bd5c3a51fc2b", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思うよネ？　あんまり\n無理したら、ミズキがケガしちゃうカモだし……。", "zh": "{$P$}也是这么想的对吧？要是太\n勉强的话，瑞希可能会受伤的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1033_p", "source_sha256": "7c5deec54ff69b52e321db8f63816ccbeb9c0e125c4289d44ed3aa52ec297f90", "ja": "そうだな。あまり無理はせず、着実に\nレッスンを重ねていった方がいいと思う。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得还是不要太勉强，踏踏实实地一点点增加练习比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "a763c79f90e4bc851d212d48d1ef5fcc358267fb83f0de07e1dc264a4de106bb", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりました。\n……。", "zh": "{$P$}……我明白了。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "66217c25cd5121bbf4e18eb280fb4b2f6469da587eb4f72b1473766d6df5af01", "ja": "瑞希、ダンス以外に何か心配なコトでもあるの？\nレッスンの時からずっと、難しい顔してる。", "zh": "瑞希，除了舞蹈以外，还有什么担心的事吗？\n从上课的时候开始，你就一直愁眉不展的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "69ad9accb2db2586e79db91248942e96139a8a4c102d5a8e04fa2fe874978e96", "ja": "星井さん……。", "zh": "星井同学……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "fa92ebaf45e33af1e12f6907b1fb7895f9ead71aabfd53268ec9860fb4cc1e30", "ja": "ミキたちでいいなら、話してみれば？\n解決できるかどうかは、わからないけど。", "zh": "如果是美希她们的话，不如试着说说看？\n虽然不知道能不能解决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "f907a70bc21c4159d577b8847e0372c570206fe481fa43160d115fb686f38c2c", "ja": "困ったら、{$P$}が助けてくれるって\n思うな。そうだよね？　{$P$}。", "zh": "遇到困难的话，美希觉得{$P$}\n一定会帮忙的。对吧？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1039_p", "source_sha256": "28398bdd5eefa4fea322b971b3d1216808af431b0063e0822b6fea81cee4f9b3", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n瑞希。悩み事があるなら、相談に乗るよ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n瑞希，要是有什么烦恼，就来找我商量吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "907d572b4b054ea0f647c814fea1bdec0cd4d176033109b41f4e6f1c4eb26db8", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりました。\n私は、この歌を、とても難しいと感じています。", "zh": "{$P$}……我明白了。\n我觉得，这首歌非常难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "d4c22e2f1352717d538d7c1a1992268f0038784b14ecc8180dc901f35112e71f", "ja": "これは、恋の歌です。好きな人に\n片想いをしている女の子の、切ない気持ち……。", "zh": "这是首恋歌。讲的是喜欢上某个人的女孩，单恋时那份苦涩的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "c193e52b27a07cbe65d82db62e79d784524fec8ad710291c22cc3bfe2344caf2", "ja": "つまり、この歌を歌うのに必要なのは……女子力。", "zh": "也就是说，唱这首歌所需要的就是……女子力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1043_p", "source_sha256": "80b0430b049cc2ce9bcec2ec4a6431f1a2ffbd07671a07111b51469a434c0e0d", "ja": "そ、そうか？\n確かに、恋の歌ではあるけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n确实是首恋爱歌曲……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "337a9224305e8caa3334a915f70582500aaca4e3d5bf0b36f1b48d8595e77d93", "ja": "あ～、それわかる！　この曲、なんていうか\n女子……！って感じがするよね！", "zh": "啊～我懂那种感觉！这首歌怎么说呢，\n很有女孩子……！的感觉对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1045_019min", "source_sha256": "f0966bee1fbcd2080eb7d4997deae2fa89c9ca12e3812fda77f86dba1776edcd", "ja": "女子かぁ……言われてみれば、たしかにそうかも。\n恋の歌だもんね。", "zh": "女孩子啊……经你这么一说，好像确实是这样呢。\n毕竟是情歌嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "f6fba48bef7387a90f2fbde7276359b4ccecdfc865f9ab28038a2dc2fd218669", "ja": "つまり、みずきんがこの曲を完璧に仕上げるには……\nやっぱり、女子力を鍛えるしかない！？", "zh": "也就是说，小瑞要想把这首歌完美地演绎出来……\n果然还是只能锻炼女子力了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1047_p", "source_sha256": "2a0eabf19990538f276fa6efece754d125fac34d20f62c42bed5ebf748036352", "ja": "いや、そういう問題じゃないような気がするけど……。\nそれで、瑞希は女子力に自信がないのか？", "zh": "不，我觉得应该不是那种问题吧……\n所以，瑞希是对自己的女子力没有自信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1048_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc9866d30f4bffde7435cd2d9d1f522a27740c0a79d413189185f6f472de3fef", "ja": "はい。……残念ながら。", "zh": "是的……很遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1049_044miz", "source_sha256": "0f70588aee3caf7dfa18f44bc25388fc66c1860b0dd28a6c6117d2b3672363e3", "ja": "{$P$}。\nどうしたら、女子力が身につくでしょう？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n要怎样才能培养出女子力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1050_p", "source_sha256": "c58e0ec68ee61552495d6696819f393d5cdfa7ba8bb856450cf30787f93dd2f3", "ja": "そ、そうだな……この歌を歌うのに\n必要なものが、女子力かどうかはさておき……。", "zh": "那、那个……先不说唱这首歌需要的到底是不是所谓的女子力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1051_p", "source_sha256": "397c5e8cd5373b4dbb1c0d04624350e4450d973ccd427a641b036252d1c3fb78", "ja": "まずは、自分なりに歌ってみるしかないと思う。\nいつでも相談に乗るし、練習にも付き合うから。", "zh": "我觉得，首先只能试着用自己的方式去唱了。\n随时都可以来找我商量，我也会陪你练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1052_044miz", "source_sha256": "b53bce749754721f5977194129804f1ea89eff223e104b9839450657a0f1cf91", "ja": "はい。ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}。……。", "zh": "好的。谢谢您，{$P$}。……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1053_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1054_p", "source_sha256": "f9f260e03ebf6bf944ee0a42807c09ed7dc1a379c23e24dce59895a2853470ee", "ja": "ふぅ、やっと仕事が片付いたぞ。\nそろそろ帰るか。", "zh": "呼……总算把工作忙完了。\n差不多该回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1055_p", "source_sha256": "1e264e13f6dbd0a64278952d861afec590e24380366156a1a65d3164ceb01433", "ja": "（あれから瑞希は、相談にこない……。本人に\n任せていたけど、明日のレッスンで話をしてみるか）", "zh": "（从那以后，瑞希没有再来找我商量……虽然交给她自己处理了，但明天训练时还是和她谈谈吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1056_044miz", "source_sha256": "28194a73208a664c66ec3c1a5ca05a1bb1a5be2d0c9839d825198e43112895ec", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1057_p", "source_sha256": "ca5f8d0ce4f19385f2a561c8b845795cc989c264a63195f0c2e18d709ec81767", "ja": "あっ、瑞希？\n今帰りなのか、ずいぶん遅かったんだな。", "zh": "啊，瑞希？\n你现在才要回去吗，真够晚的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1058_044miz", "source_sha256": "2d301ca1d060780b28081b8e96554ee456dc9ba0efc5bc783bba6a495bde2e68", "ja": "はい。実は、{$P$}に\n相談したいことがあって。控え室で、待っていました。", "zh": "是的。其实，我有件事想和{$P$}商量，所以一直在休息室等着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1059_p", "source_sha256": "f6ed6623c83a3746402fc0b88eddb28d84e44a5bb4ce84deed778e54d3c2921b", "ja": "そうだったのか？　事務室にいたんだから、\n声を掛けてくれれば良かったのに……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊？我当时就在办公室，你叫我一声不就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1060_044miz", "source_sha256": "fd9c892edb9249094a7500e455520cfc1af9d523f58d1b3023d371ee614239a7", "ja": "それでは、お仕事の邪魔になりますから。\n私も控え室で学校の課題をしていたので、大丈夫です。", "zh": "那样啊？既然你当时在办公室，叫我一声不就好了……\n\n那样会打扰您工作的。而且我也在休息室做学校的作业，所以没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1061_p", "source_sha256": "b08a0354c40b4d39e6898110fd474397c752ad9b6e69507b48a3382eab329cf0", "ja": "そうか……気を遣ってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢你的体贴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1087_p", "source_sha256": "7c1f312d206044867a2e2a65480588db20e8a6499a5cdce16fae9a892b20b351", "ja": "相談っていうのは、公演の新曲の事か？", "zh": "你说的咨询，是关于公演新歌的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1062_044miz", "source_sha256": "2b39feb474ce2173caa58fbe49fa588d1963ac08f28dacee6271b505c19e1a76", "ja": "はい。それもあるのですが……\n{$P$}。", "zh": "是的。那也是其中一件事……  \n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1063_044miz", "source_sha256": "8448ccd16e21bf583e285636a9eb51ebb3d5e638e3b8eb7da6cc3c38129bccb4", "ja": "私は……私も、他のみんなのように、\n髪を伸ばした方が良いと思いますか？", "zh": "你觉得……我是不是也该像其他人一样，把头发留长呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1064_p", "source_sha256": "86e6a3a3ab3f588fa9bcdd5b2d148ea29e8e911c71e2bd96af26c03816c533c4", "ja": "えっ？　髪を伸ばすって……随分、突然だな。\nどうしてだ？", "zh": "诶？要留长头发……这也太突然了吧。为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1065_044miz", "source_sha256": "ec80a7ddf401a9fa6f6850f2c60fe9de250a660ad5f1681367bdfa9b27f6547d", "ja": "はい。髪を伸ばしたら、\n女子力が高まるのではないかと思いました。", "zh": "是的。我想，留长头发的话，女性魅力或许会提升。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1066_044miz", "source_sha256": "142ecf9294a1d420fc56bccc8e02a241e4a92a8ce3a27521e51c3429084b1927", "ja": "けど、今からでは、次の公演に間に合いません。\n……ピンチだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "可是，现在开始留头发的话，就赶不上下一场公演了。\n……这下糟糕了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1067_p", "source_sha256": "f73466e19d411eee2fdc5c0f7a22b6e206cd4c5474464d51227239c5ccda0be7", "ja": "いや。その前に、髪を伸ばしたくらいじゃ\n女子力は高まらないような気もするけど……。", "zh": "不，比起那个，我总觉得就算留长了头发，\n女子力也不见得就会提升就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1068_p", "source_sha256": "9692f4daef15d9565b27661750982939cb78ee4f131977d772eaba199eea590a", "ja": "それに瑞希には、今の髪型が似合ってると思うよ。\nどうして、そんな風に思ったんだ？", "zh": "而且我觉得瑞希现在的发型很适合她。\n你为什么会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1069_044miz", "source_sha256": "0a220ab0dee4be398faa921606d00c1776bf6732cce8d44c8ad10db92c97b546", "ja": "はい。先日私は、恋の歌を歌うには、女子力が\nあったほうがいいのではないか、という話をしました。", "zh": "是的。前几天我说过，要唱恋爱歌曲的话，还是有女孩子气一点比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1070_044miz", "source_sha256": "174262b319b0e394028d1a86c3bc6586700ec17fcb9c85818b68734fc82f1818", "ja": "そして、ついに今日。レッスンをしている時、\n気づいたのです。……みんな、髪が長い。", "zh": "然后，就在今天。练习的时候，我终于注意到了……大家的头发都很长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1071_044miz", "source_sha256": "8d2afd621a20b8bf0e3cff3a5b397b824e00f378f6105d35d68a5996290f19b9", "ja": "星井さんも高坂さんも、佐竹さんも島原さんも。\nみんな、とても素敵です。……女子力もあります。", "zh": "星井小姐、高坂小姐、佐竹小姐，还有岛原小姐。大家都非常漂亮……也都很有女生魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1072_p", "source_sha256": "209f81b69e578c8218126a607fd78f833ca088c56449e1082b5aeef575f91223", "ja": "な、なるほど。確かにそのメンバーは、\nみんなロングヘアだな……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。确实，这些成员全都是长发啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1073_044miz", "source_sha256": "9a591633275a16634cacc0e2ab5ca294b5603e7e6ef350007c99a2c3aaa316f0", "ja": "なので私も、髪を伸ばせば、すこしは女子力が\n強化されるのではないかと。……どうかな。", "zh": "所以我觉得，只要把头发留长，或许也能稍微提升一点女孩子力……你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1074_p", "source_sha256": "36648c552dcac906d38284370ca5aed2715be30a1c0d8aa560e4fb9da76fbe4d", "ja": "（そもそも瑞希の悩みは、女子力があるかどうかが\n問題じゃないんだろう。瑞希が気にしているのは……）", "zh": "说到底，瑞希烦恼的并不是有没有女孩子气。她在意的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1075_p", "source_sha256": "97fbfb91e362c3afbe82eabc4207be13d44607862667382fb1bfdf885607d9a4", "ja": "うーん……さっきも言ったとおり、\n女子力の高さは、髪の長さだけじゃないと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯……就像刚才说的，女孩子的魅力并不只是头发的长短。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1076_044miz", "source_sha256": "dcf30be8027cdc20b10a3a4620b1747a1cb47bf1b8f746adafd99804ec29c448", "ja": "なんと、そうですか。……しゅん。", "zh": "原来如此啊……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1077_p", "source_sha256": "cfb57387942b0098392f5a88a1f01c59cc3f143e04a0798223d1513f35df4193", "ja": "いや、落ち込む必要はないよ。それに瑞希はもう、\nちゃんと女子力を持っているじゃないか。", "zh": "不，没必要消沉。而且瑞希不是已经拥有十足的女子力了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1078_044miz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1079_p", "source_sha256": "63e719211627d0b4b368c07a4a36a573724d816831062395837e885931e7c162", "ja": "今だって、俺の仕事の邪魔をしないように\n終わるまで待っていてくれたじゃないか。", "zh": "刚才你不也是为了不打扰我的工作，一直等到我忙完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1081_p", "source_sha256": "b30028440a3cc00a25884cc7e4dbb8fcc7e96059f8d54e4c81771fc8b3c0b516", "ja": "目立つようなものじゃないかもしれないけど、\n瑞希のそういう優しさは、ちゃんと届いてるよ。", "zh": "虽然这也许不是什么引人注目的事，但瑞希的这份温柔，我确实感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1082_p", "source_sha256": "63816e7f2249785eff3cbc39d754cfa467e8b7f081fed47696f270d6dbeff69b", "ja": "きっと劇場のみんなや、ファンのみんなにも\n届いてるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想一定也传达给剧场的大家，还有所有粉丝了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1083_044miz", "source_sha256": "596c73bf258a1ea8b313982c8dd1f9c98e62482fb0f3ed5759d68aefcbbf6329", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n私は……私でも、いいんでしょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n我……由我来，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1084_044miz", "source_sha256": "d52ea5dd9c44385f33adb71164fbf72fa9acc0749791046ffc6bf1be93754da0", "ja": "私は、感情を表現することが、得意ではありません。\nそんな私でも……。", "zh": "我不擅长表达感情。即使是这样的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1085_044miz", "source_sha256": "d3e65b34d255670bde336d894917164bb79347e80407acb8dc878762ffdce767", "ja": "恋の歌を歌って……\n大好きな人たちに、届けたいと思ってもいいですか？", "zh": "唱着恋爱的歌……\n就算是我，也可以想着把它传达给最喜欢的人们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_1086", "source_sha256": "eb03e7828b7f68c47b56ef97858a930a19d452f43b0db189368a8e589b70feca", "ja": "いい！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2000_p", "source_sha256": "91771450c2a07017fe56f823b8856377c469ca3f018a10297f7babd3eb782baf", "ja": "もちろん。瑞希が届けたいと思った人たちに、\n届けてあげてほしい。そのための新曲だ。", "zh": "当然。请把它送到瑞希想传达给的人们那里。这就是为此而创作的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2001_p", "source_sha256": "0e3a10ef17dbfef2221543fe4adbe4e90384882d9b4094edaba1638311f2ccfa", "ja": "そうだな。瑞希の歌で、みんなを\n恋に落としてしまえばいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊。要不就用瑞希的歌，让大家坠入爱河？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2002_044miz", "source_sha256": "561cd3798ef1dd795d0edb06039ee881d0bf7291ec59f69262e1271d2dbfe073", "ja": "私の歌で、みんなを恋に落とす。\n…………。……きゅん。", "zh": "用我的歌，让大家坠入爱河。\n…………。……心动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2003_p", "source_sha256": "9272d465ee90407ab522780fcadad3e34a68436945d0ea192b3accdf44d99dc3", "ja": "ん？　きゅん？", "zh": "嗯？心动了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "d3e79987418c2e121a025e8d4f567a5168763819fe70a444dccbc6ababf80cf1", "ja": "いえ、なんでもありません。\n……ありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "不，没什么。\n……谢谢您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2005_044miz", "source_sha256": "cd7ed167a5c4aa74142bed1b576608e84231998c6be0e7e8c09ca41cc01b457f", "ja": "自信はまだ、ありませんが。がんばります。\n……それと、もうひとつ。", "zh": "虽然我还没有信心，但我会努力的。\n……还有一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2006_044miz", "source_sha256": "7bd57fea6e3d233561c36a6300392e3983160a98a7ed106fd3c0679e8d0e7e47", "ja": "次の公演で、新曲のお披露目が無事に終わったら。\nまた、私の話を聞いてくれますか？", "zh": "如果下次公演能顺利完成新歌的首次演出，您还愿意再听我说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2007_p", "source_sha256": "1fe4a88c99a1fd1fd6c08dfd0559bca22b3cc7ada89945b87b9d6bcd3c5cf3bd", "ja": "もちろん。\nけど、まだ何か心配な事があるのか？", "zh": "当然可以。\n不过，你还有什么放心不下的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2008_044miz", "source_sha256": "72308f616e4d7762c961a350bb3bde09bca469f09af180c4dd08a67a26cb6729", "ja": "いえ、そうではありません。\n……では、公演が終わったら、お願いします。", "zh": "不，不是那样的。\n……那么，等演出结束后，就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_050_2009_p", "source_sha256": "e83ec215c367e6ffe4db692c1cfb36ea047feafb334a8ceade470c4fc8acd1ea", "ja": "（そう言った瑞希の表情は、柔らかな笑顔だった。\n大丈夫。瑞希の歌は、ファンの心にきっと届くはずだ）", "zh": "（说出这番话的瑞希，脸上带着柔和的笑容。\n没事的。瑞希的歌声一定能传达到粉丝们的心中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
